Package: MSiteR
Type: Package
Title: CpG Methylation Cross-Pipeline Consensus Filtering
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Jace", "Ellis",
      email = "ellisjacem@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tools for filtering, comparing, and merging CpG methylation
    calls across multiple alignment/calling pipelines (Bismark, BWA-meth,
    Biscuit, ENCODE), including strand-level and consensus-level read-depth
    thresholding, and strand-symmetric CpG merging.
